<title>UK: Cowie Group re-defined on London exchange.</title>
<headline>Cowie Group re-defined on London exchange.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowie Group Plc said that the London Stock Exchange will from today classify it as a transport group instead of a motor distributor.</p>
<p>The reclassification follows Cowies' recent purchases of British Bus for 282.3 milion stg and North East Bus for 24.5 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
